Package: CellCycleDiag
Type: Package
Title: Diagnose Between-Group Cell-Cycle Imbalance and DE Sensitivity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CellCycleDiag", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Quantifies between-group cell-cycle-state distribution imbalance
    using score-based Kolmogorov-Smirnov distances and binned cyclic-position
    total variation distance. Optionally compares differential expression
    under direct, score-adjusted and cyclic-adjusted models. These descriptive
    diagnostics do not determine whether correction is biologically required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils
Suggests: Seurat (>= 4.3.0), SeuratObject (>= 4.1.0),
    SingleCellExperiment, SummarizedExperiment, tricycle, MAST,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
